                <mxCell id="b2-hdr" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px; color:#FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;LUỒNG 2 — ONLINE 2-STAGE NEURAL RAG &amp;amp; GROUNDED CITATION PIPELINE (STEP 9 &amp;rarr; STEP 14)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#7C3AED;strokeColor=#7C3AED;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="50" y="506" width="1580" height="28" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                
                <mxCell id="s9" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#991B1B; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Step 9: Mobile Query &amp;amp; Kiểm Quyền RBAC 🔴 (Spring Boot)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left; font-size:10.5px; color:#1E293B;&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Sinh viên đặt câu hỏi tiếng Việt (có hoặc không dấu) gửi &lt;b&gt;POST /api/v1/rag/query&lt;/b&gt; kèm Bearer JWT.&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; Spring Boot xác thực JWT, trích &lt;i&gt;authorizedLectureIds&lt;/i&gt; &amp;rarr; chuyển tiếp &lt;b&gt;POST /internal/v1/ai/rag/query (Cách 2)&lt;/b&gt; kèm &lt;i&gt;X-Internal-Secret&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;arcSize=10;spacing=7;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="50" y="544" width="500" height="118" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s10" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#0F766E; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Step 10 [Q1-Q2]: Semantic Cache &amp;amp; Query Embedding ✅&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left; font-size:10.5px; color:#1E293B;&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;[Q1] CompositeTelemetryStore ✅:&lt;/b&gt; nhúng query gốc (không dùng [Q0]), tra &lt;i&gt;rag.semantic_query_cache&lt;/i&gt; Cosine &amp;ge; &lt;b&gt;0.95&lt;/b&gt; + &lt;b&gt;prompt_hash&lt;/b&gt;; Hit trả ngay.&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;[Q2] BgeM3Embedder.encode_query() ✅&lt;/b&gt; xuất &lt;i&gt;halfvec(1024)&lt;/i&gt; cho tầng RAG.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=10;spacing=7;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="588" y="544" width="500" height="118" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s11" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#166534; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Step 11 [Q2]: Tầng RAG — 3-Stream Hybrid Search RRF ✅&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left; font-size:10.5px; color:#1E293B;&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;ChunkStore.search_hybrid_rrf()&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;i&gt;/search/hybrid&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;/rag/retrieve&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;/rag/query&lt;/i&gt;) gọi &lt;b&gt;rag.search_vietnamese_rag_rrf()&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;1) &lt;b&gt;Dense HNSW:&lt;/b&gt; Cosine &lt;i&gt;halfvec(1024)&lt;/i&gt; | 2) &lt;b&gt;Lexical:&lt;/b&gt; GIN &lt;i&gt;tsv_content&lt;/i&gt; | 3) &lt;b&gt;Fuzzy:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;pg_trgm&lt;/i&gt; &amp;gt; 0.15.&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; Hợp nhất điểm RRF &amp;Sigma; 1/(60+rank) &amp;rarr; &lt;b&gt;Top 25 ứng viên&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=10;spacing=7;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1126" y="544" width="502" height="118" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                
                <mxCell id="s12" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#166534; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Step 12 [Q3-Q4]: Context Expand &amp;amp; Cross-Encoder Reranking ✅&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left; font-size:10.5px; color:#1E293B;&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;[Q3] Context Expand ✅:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;rag.get_expanded_context()&lt;/i&gt; lấy liền kề &lt;b&gt;PREVIOUS + CURRENT + NEXT&lt;/b&gt; kèm &lt;b&gt;[MM:SS]&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;[Q4] BgeRerankerV2M3 ✅:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;bge-reranker-v2-m3&lt;/i&gt; (2.27 GB) chấm cặp [Query, Expanded] lọc &lt;b&gt;Top K&lt;/b&gt; + &lt;i&gt;unload()&lt;/i&gt; VRAM &amp;rarr; kết thúc &lt;b&gt;/rag/retrieve&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=10;spacing=7;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="50" y="684" width="500" height="116" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s13" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#0F766E; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Step 13 [Q5–Q7+]: GroundedPromptBuilder &amp;amp; Custom System Prompt ✅&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left; font-size:10.5px; color:#1E293B;&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;[Q5] Pass 1 RAG Draft:&lt;/b&gt; tổng hợp &lt;i&gt;draft_answer&lt;/i&gt; bám sát Top K [MM:SS].&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;[Q6] Pass 2 Custom Refiner:&lt;/b&gt; tiêm &lt;i&gt;systemPrompt&lt;/i&gt; / preset (&lt;i&gt;qa_refine / cornell_notes / quiz_json&lt;/i&gt;) &amp;amp; &lt;i&gt;responseFormat (text|json)&lt;/i&gt; + &lt;b&gt;[Q7+] extraStages&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;i&gt;/llm/generate&lt;/i&gt;).&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0D9488;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=10;spacing=7;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="588" y="684" width="500" height="116" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s14" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#166534; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Step 14 [Q5–Q6+]: Gemma 4 Dual Runtime, Audit Log &amp;amp; Citations ✅&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left; font-size:10.5px; color:#1E293B;&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;CompositeLLMClient ✅:&lt;/b&gt; ưu tiên &lt;i&gt;OllamaGemmaClient&lt;/i&gt; (:11434) hoặc &lt;i&gt;TransformersGemmaClient&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;i&gt;gemma-4-e4b&lt;/i&gt;, BF16/FP32, &lt;i&gt;unload()&lt;/i&gt;).&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; Ghi &lt;i&gt;rag_audit_logs&lt;/i&gt; + &lt;i&gt;semantic_query_cache&lt;/i&gt; &amp;rarr; trả &lt;i&gt;draft_answer, answer, stage_outputs, citations [MM:SS]&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;arcSize=10;spacing=7;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1126" y="684" width="502" height="116" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
                
